{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted"]}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide is the shortest path from a wired Swidux app with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":" registered to events landing in Mixpanel. It assumes you have already followed Swidux’s "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" guide through Step 5 — that is, your "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" slice, your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":" routes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".analytics(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and you have an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsMapper"},{"type":"text","text":" declared."}]},{"anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Add the package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" File > Add Package Dependencies, paste "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},{"type":"text","text":". Add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"},{"text":" product to your target.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Package.swift:"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\", from: \"1.0.0\"),"]},{"code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\", package: \"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Build-the-service-at-launch","type":"heading","text":"Build the service at launch"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" owns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"text":" internally — you do not need to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":". Construct the service with your token (and any Mixpanel knobs you care about) before configuring the store:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import SwiftUI","","@main","struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var store: AppStore","","    init() {","        let analyticsService = MixpanelAnalyticsService(","            token: \"your-mixpanel-token\",","            optOutTrackingByDefault: true","        )","        _store = State(wrappedValue: AppStore.configured(analyticsService: analyticsService))","    }","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup { ContentView().environment(store) }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initializer surfaces every Mixpanel knob the app would otherwise need to set on "},{"code":"Mixpanel.initialize","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (EU "},{"code":"serverURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"optOutTrackingByDefault"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flushInterval"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instanceName"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superProperties"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"useGzipCompression"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackAutomaticEvents"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"excludeProperties"},{"text":") and is identical on every platform. Pick what you need; everything else has a sensible default. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"text":" for the longer treatment.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Register-the-plugin-with-MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"heading","text":"Register the plugin with `MixpanelAnalyticsService`"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the service to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" in your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store.configured()"},{"type":"text","text":" factory:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Swidux","import SwiduxAnalytics","import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","","extension Store where State == AppState, Action == AppAction {","    static func configured(analyticsService: some AnalyticsService) -> AppStore {","        let plugins = PluginHost<AppState, AppAction>()","","        plugins.register(","            AnalyticsPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","                state: \\.analytics,","                action: AppAction.analytics,","                extractAction: { if case .analytics(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","                service: analyticsService,","                mapper: analyticsMapper,","                identity: analyticsIdentity","            )","        )","","        return Store(","            initialState: AppState(),","            reducer: AppReducer().reduce,","            plugins: plugins","        )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That’s it — the plugin will route mapped events through the service, re-fire ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identify"},{"text":" whenever the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(userID, userProperties)"},{"text":" pair derived from state changes, and flush on your call to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.analyticsPlugin.flush()"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scenePhase == .background"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Verify-the-wiring","text":"Verify the wiring","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dispatch a screen view from your root view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":" and confirm the event arrives in Mixpanel’s Live View:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        RootContent()","            .onAppear { store.send(.analytics(.screenView(\"Home\"))) }","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"Next-Steps","text":"Next Steps","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","type":"reference"},{"text":" — EU residency, opt-out by default, multiple Mixpanel projects, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelInstance"},{"text":" escape hatch.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Drive analytics state from previews and tests using ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ValueTranslation","type":"reference"},{"text":" — How ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsValue"},{"text":" cases map onto Mixpanel ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Properties"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"role":"article"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice","abstract":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"text":" in your app.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","role":"article","kind":"article","title":"How to Implement the Service","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixp